Package: bionemor
Title: Use BioNeMo Recipes Evo 2 from R
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tomasz", "Kalinowski", , "kalinowskit@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Prepare MBridge checkpoints, run generation, scoring, and
    embeddings, and fine-tune Evo 2 models with the versioned NVIDIA BioNeMo
    Recipes runtime while working in R. Recipe commands run in external local
    or container processes and return portable R results. Slurm support is
    experimental.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor
BugReports: https://github.com/t-kalinowski/bionemor/issues
OS_type: unix
